WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.061 --> 00:00:10.598
Beauty looked around.

2
00:00:10.599 --> 00:00:15.049
Father said the forest was cursed.

3
00:00:15.050 --> 00:00:21.085
It was dark, but it didn't seem cursed.

4
00:00:21.086 --> 00:00:24.627
They kept walking through the thick forest.

5
00:00:24.628 --> 00:00:27.380
"Father!" Beauty called.

6
00:00:27.381 --> 00:00:29.849
"Where are you?"

7
00:00:29.850 --> 00:00:32.499
She stopped to listen.

8
00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:35.848
But no answer came.

9
00:00:35.849 --> 00:00:40.796
Deer walked deeper and deeper into the forest.

10
00:00:40.797 --> 00:00:43.653
Suddenly Beauty heard voices.

11
00:00:43.654 --> 00:00:46.163
Some men were talking.

12
00:00:46.164 --> 00:00:51.201
"Father!" Beauty called. "Is that you?"

13
00:00:51.202 --> 00:00:55.075
"Who's there?" someone shouted back.

14
00:00:55.076 --> 00:00:56.900
Beauty froze.

15
00:00:56.901 --> 00:00:59.494
It wasn't Father's voice.

16
00:00:59.495 --> 00:01:02.832
But it didn't sound like a monster either.

17
00:01:02.833 --> 00:01:06.490
"I'm Beauty, who are you?"

18
00:01:06.491 --> 00:01:12.394
Two men stepped out from behind a tree.

19
00:01:12.395 --> 00:01:15.010
One carried a bow and arrow.

20
00:01:15.011 --> 00:01:17.899
The other held a sword.

21
00:01:17.900 --> 00:01:22.332
"We're hunting for the monster of the forest," one said.

22
00:01:22.333 --> 00:01:27.212
The other nodded. "You shouldn't be here alone."

23
00:01:27.213 --> 00:01:30.893
"I'm not alone," Beauty thought.

24
00:01:30.894 --> 00:01:34.000
But she couldn't tell them about Deer!

25
00:01:34.001 --> 00:01:38.727
"I'm looking for my father," Beauty said.

26
00:01:38.728 --> 00:01:44.520
"The monster probably got him," one man said.

27
00:01:44.521 --> 00:01:48.904
"Go home, miss, before it gets you too!"

28
00:01:48.905 --> 00:01:53.890
"Not until I find my father," Beauty said firmly.

29
00:01:53.891 --> 00:01:59.737
The men shrugged and hurried off.

30
00:01:59.738 --> 00:02:14.033
Soon Deer led Beauty under a tunnel of trees.

31
00:02:14.034 --> 00:02:20.585
Then they were in a lovely garden.

32
00:02:20.586 --> 00:02:25.399
Beauty smiled. "It's beautiful here.

33
00:02:25.400 --> 00:02:29.079
Is this where you get the fruit and flowers?"

34
00:02:29.080 --> 00:02:33.591
Deer nodded.

35
00:02:33.592 --> 00:02:38.977
Then she waved a hoof at the fruit.

36
00:02:38.978 --> 00:02:43.279
"It's okay, Deer," Beauty said.

37
00:02:43.280 --> 00:02:46.498
"Let's keep looking for Father."

38
00:02:46.499 --> 00:02:50.193
The deer tapped her hoof and wouldn't move.

39
00:02:50.194 --> 00:02:56.143
Finally Beauty shrugged. "Okay, I'll have an apple.

40
00:02:56.144 --> 00:02:59.546
I am a little hungry."

41
00:02:59.547 --> 00:03:03.250
Beauty picked a pretty red apple.

42
00:03:03.251 --> 00:03:08.862
She took one bite. "Mmm."

43
00:03:08.863 --> 00:03:17.891
Suddenly everything went black!

